      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Living with asthma is a challenging task. Learning to live with asthma using a self-management plan helps patients to achieve control of their asthma. Self-management and control tend to improve quality of life. This article relates one nurse's experience of living with asthma to self-management, partnership with the health care team, quality of life, and control of asthma."},
